cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the FCP Federation demonstration, cite its exact source revision or immutable archived release."
title: "FCP: Capability-Oriented Federation Demonstration"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Andersen"
    given-names: "Martin Arthur"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-9991-3578"
version: "0.2.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible demonstration of FCP capability-oriented federation.
  It evaluates selective contribution, capability-specific authority, runtime
  provider eligibility, and durable ownership boundaries using production FCP
  control-plane components with deterministic stand-ins for external physical
  services and observations.
keywords:
  - federation
  - capability-oriented systems
  - digital twins
  - software engineering
  - research software
  - reproducibility
